# Folio — Environment variable reference
#
# Folio NEVER reads a literal `.env` file at runtime. This file is a
# documentation reference for the values you set in:
#   - Cloudflare Worker secrets (via `wrangler secret put` or Infisical sync)
#   - Cloudflare Worker [vars] in the relevant wrangler-*.toml
#
# The extension itself ships no server-side secrets; Raindrop OAuth is brokered
# through the `folio-oauth` worker.

# ─── folio-oauth worker (wrangler-oauth.toml) ─────────────────────────────────
# Domain: oauth.folio.daiquiri.dev
# Purpose: Raindrop.io OAuth code exchange + token refresh.

# Public OAuth client identifier — safe to commit (set as [vars] in the toml).
RAINDROP_CLIENT_ID=your_raindrop_client_id_here

# OAuth client secret — set with `wrangler secret put RAINDROP_CLIENT_SECRET --config wrangler-oauth.toml`
# Source: https://raindrop.io/developer (Create / regenerate app)
RAINDROP_CLIENT_SECRET=secret_only_in_wrangler_secrets

# Random 32+ byte hex string — signs the OAuth state/session payload.
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
# Set with: wrangler secret put SESSION_SECRET --config wrangler-oauth.toml
SESSION_SECRET=set_via_wrangler_secret_put

# ─── folio-sync worker (wrangler-sync.toml) ───────────────────────────────────
# Domain: sync.folio.daiquiri.dev
# Purpose: E2E encrypted bookmark + extension backup. Stores only opaque
# ciphertext — no Raindrop credentials needed here.

# R2 bucket binding (declared in the toml, not as a secret).
# Bucket name: folio-bookmark-sync
SYNC_BUCKET=r2_binding_via_toml

# ─── Optional: legacy login-with-raindrop worker (wrangler.toml) ──────────────
# Older worker — only needed if you are still deploying it. Mirrors the
# folio-oauth secret set.
# RAINDROP_CLIENT_ID=...
# RAINDROP_CLIENT_SECRET=...
# SESSION_SECRET=...

# ─── Infisical pull (cloudflare/deploy.sh) ────────────────────────────────────
# Local-only env for the deploy script. Loaded from ~/.claude/.secrets.env —
# never committed.
#   INFISICAL_CLIENT_ID=...
#   INFISICAL_CLIENT_SECRET=...
#   INFISICAL_API_URL=https://infisical.daiquiri.dev
# Run: cd cloudflare && ./deploy.sh
